{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S06—S09：在对方是否也舍不得这份亲近、自己能否一直陪在对方身边之间摆动。S07产生期待，S08又没底，S09具体害怕失去，但最后借眼下对方仍然亲近的事实重新安定下来。这种反复有推进，担忧逐渐具体化。\",\n    \"S11—S14：在不再隐藏喜欢、愿意一直陪伴，与担心对方未来不再需要自己、想少表达一点以免受伤之间摆动。S13重新考虑退回去，S14最终明确选择不再隐藏，形成了新的认识和决定。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S05—S06：S05担心对方嫌自己太黏，觉得原本熟悉的亲近像隔了一层；S06虽然发现对方相处方式没有变化，却又回到对方不知道自己有多怕被嫌弃的孤单里。同一份被嫌弃的担忧没有真正消化。\",\n    \"S06—S09：反复摆动于对方是否需要自己。S07已经推测对方可能需要自己的陪伴、和自己在一起也安心；S08进一步期待两人能长久如此；S09又退回对方可能不再需要自己的恐惧，最后再次用对方可能喜欢有自己陪伴来安慰自己。尤其S07与S09的正面猜测基本回到了同一个位置。\",\n    \"S11—S14：在不隐藏喜欢、愿意一直陪伴，与害怕对方未来不再需要自己、想把露出的喜欢藏回去之间摆动。S13再次回到退缩的念头，S14才重新选择坦然接受不确定的未来。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条都有喜欢与害怕失去之间的反复，但Y更明显地把同一个问题反复提出又暂时安慰：尤其S07已经形成的对方可能需要自己的判断，在S09又被重新猜测一遍；S05—S06也重复了被嫌弃的担忧。X相应位置更多是从期待走向具体的不安，再借现实证据调整认识，重复感较弱。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ca41cf6-6b9b-4083-af90-3f466b3bc76e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T085617480649Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:57:01.294393+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f4e711acf477b011f0f7c0038a4f9ce97d9f55b604bf2aaf42686d2c035d19f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T085617480649Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "874f56f227b71a0a8b0518fe6ff3cea81c25a456f86d020f886f8fb54c488c1b"}}}
